                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-07T19:40:00-05:19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 7,
                                1903, 7.40 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of the Navy</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington, D. C.:</hi></p>
                <p>All quiet; traffic undisturbed; message to prevent received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Diehl.</hi></signed></closer>
